    "body": "Distribution update \u2014 15 September 2026\r\n\r\nThe large PRIMITIVE_357_FIRST_SUBMISSION_COMPANION_V1.zip asset has been withdrawn because it included a copy of the Dahmen\u2013Siksek working paper without redistribution permission. A replacement that omits that paper is being prepared. The original filename and SHA-256 value remain in the historical audit records; they do not identify an available download.\r\n\r\nThe author\u2019s own earlier PDF and two-file source ZIP remain here as historical manuscript versions. The current revised manuscript and source upload are linked from the [repository README](https://github.com/bbpcho/primitive-357-proof-audit). No arXiv submission has been made.\r\n\r\nThis withdrawal changes distribution, not the mathematical statements or the scope of the previously recorded computations. The earlier replay records retain their original input identities; no new complete arithmetic replay is claimed. Other third-party redistribution matters remain under review.\r\n\r\nSHA256SUMS.txt is retained as the original asset ledger, including the withdrawn companion. GitHub\u2019s automatically generated source archives contain the smaller control repository."
