    "body": "Distribution update \u2014 15 September 2026\r\n\r\nPRIMITIVE_357_VERIFIED_RELEASE_2026-09-14_V1.zip has been withdrawn because a nested evidence archive included a copy of the Dahmen\u2013Siksek working paper without redistribution permission. A replacement that omits that paper is being prepared.\r\n\r\nThe original archive identity remains recorded for provenance: SHA-256 27e3e6eeb50f83ea484e7cd0c94dbd88de0141ab9f47634ed5181e7db0ecba33; 588,945,520 bytes. The attached checksum file is a historical record, not a currently available archive.\r\n\r\nThe previously completed integrated replay covered 65 prior-arithmetic jobs, 13 sector/interface jobs and 16 rank/local checks. Its records retain their original input identities and scope. This distribution correction does not claim a fresh replay or proof-assistant formalization. Other third-party redistribution matters remain under review.\r\n\r\nThe earlier project manuscript remains attached for historical reference. For the current paper, source upload and audit status, use the [repository README](https://github.com/bbpcho/primitive-357-proof-audit). No arXiv submission has been made. GitHub\u2019s automatically generated source archives contain only the smaller control repository."
